{"id":"H6147","lemma":"עֵר","transliteration":"er","sayIt":"ER","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Er","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.38.3;\nson of: Judah (H3063) and Bath-shua (H1323I);\nbrother of: Onan (H0209) and Shelah (H7956);\nhalf-brother of: Perez (H6557) and Zerah (H2226I); married to Tamar (H8559)\n§ Er = \"awake\"\n1) the eldest son of Judah\n2) son of Shelah and grandson of Judah","glosses":["er"],"count":7,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"Er"}},{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"for Er","kjv":"for Er"}},{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Er","kjv":"And Er"}},{"chapterId":"gen-46","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Er","kjv":"Er"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"were Er","kjv":"were Er"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"Er","kjv":"Er"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Er","kjv":"Er"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 38:3","note":"She conceived, and bore a son; and he named him Er.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 26:19","note":"The sons of Judah: Er and Onan. Er and Onan died in the land of Canaan.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:3","note":"The sons of Judah: Er, Onan, and Shelah; which three were born to him of Shua’s daughter the Canaanitess. Er, Judah’s firstborn, was wicked in Yahweh’s sight…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H7956","lemma":"שֵׁלָה","transliteration":"shelah","gloss":"Shelah"},{"id":"H0209","lemma":"אוֹנָן","transliteration":"onan","gloss":"Onan"},{"id":"H1323","lemma":"בַּת","transliteration":"bat","gloss":"daughter"},{"id":"H2226","lemma":"זֶ֫רַח","transliteration":"zerach","gloss":"Zerah"},{"id":"H3063","lemma":"יְהוּדָה","transliteration":"yehudah","gloss":"Judah"},{"id":"H3101","lemma":"יוֹאָשׁ","transliteration":"yoash","gloss":"Joash"},{"id":"H3137","lemma":"יוֹקִים","transliteration":"yoqim","gloss":"Jokim"},{"id":"H3922","lemma"